  "body": "As per the discussion in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/59444, it currently doesn't.\n\nI think it'd be a matter of changing \"same-origin\" to \"CORS-same-origin\" in the quirk's definition.\n\nThat matches Gecko, and maybe Blink judging by https://wpt.fyi/results/html/semantics/document-metadata/the-link-element/link-style-data-url-quirks.html ?\n\ncc @annevk ",
